      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The didactic lecture deals with four questions: What is the origin of an isolated indolent arthropathy? diabetes, amylose, leprosis. What diagnosis in an adult familial form? Thevenard's disease when amylosis has been excluded. What are the varieties of congenital indolent arthropathies? An early recessive form of Thevenard's disease and the congenital analgesia. How to deal with a unilateral indolent arthropathy? First of all, look for dysraphism."},
